  "work": {
    "abstract_text": "We give an alternative proof of Jovovic's 2003 exponential generating function and resolve Mathar's Conjecture in OEIS A084261, FORMULA, 30 November 2012, for every integer n >= 3. For a(n,t)=sum binomial(n,2k) k! t^(n-2k), the fixed-point-weighted generating function of Fang, Hamaker and Troyka (2020; journal version 2022) yields an explicit polynomial recurrence. A common moment representation also proves the recorded row sums, continued fraction, Hankel product and asymptotic equivalent, the last extending to every fixed real t > 0.",
